Package: mglpa
Type: Package
Title: Multi-Group Latent Profile Analysis and Tests of Profile Similarity
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mehmet Cahit", "Marangoz",
           email = "191721087+cahitgs@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0850-2251")))
Description: Estimates latent profile analysis (LPA) models with continuous
    indicators across known groups and implements the sequence of multi-group
    tests of profile similarity proposed by Morin, Meyer, Creusier and Bietry
    (2016) <doi:10.1177/1094428115621148>: class enumeration, configural,
    structural, dispersion, distributional, predictive and explanatory
    similarity. Estimation is carried out in R with an expectation-maximisation
    algorithm using random starts, with maximum-likelihood and robust
    (sandwich) standard errors, so that no external mixture-modelling software
    is required.
